{"source": "tts:kokoro:af_heart", "precision": "tts", "offset": 0, "duration": 94.979, "sentences": [{"text": "The whole production stack runs on one laptop, with one command.", "start": 0, "end": 3.636}, {"text": "Make up starts fifteen containers: the edge, the gateway, the site, the meter's database, the model server, and the tools that watch them, from metrics and logs to Grafana and Langfuse.", "start": 3.886, "end": 15.07}, {"text": "The model server is llama dot cpp on the laptop's GPU, running Qwen3, thirty billion parameters, in twenty-one of the card's twenty-four gigabytes.", "start": 15.32, "end": 25.622}, {"text": "Every question tries it first.", "start": 25.872, "end": 27.465}, {"text": "A local answer costs nothing, and nothing leaves the machine.", "start": 27.714, "end": 30.969}, {"text": "Only when it's down does the capped paid fallback answer.", "start": 31.22, "end": 34.007}, {"text": "On the cloud server, which has no GPU, the Anthropic API answers first.", "start": 34.257, "end": 39.203}, {"text": "This is production, not a demo: every image pinned by its digest, and one build at one commit, the same image everywhere.", "start": 39.453, "end": 47.079}, {"text": "Offline-first isn't new for Hareet.", "start": 47.329, "end": 49.249}, {"text": "At Medic, the community health workers using the Community Health Toolkit had older Android phones, and mostly no network.", "start": 49.499, "end": 56.56}, {"text": "So Hareet designed Voice for CHT: the health worker speaks the visit, and the form fills itself, offline.", "start": 56.81, "end": 63.457}, {"text": "Hareet helped the team fine-tune its models to two hundred seventy-three megabytes, to run beside the app on a four-gigabyte phone.", "start": 63.707, "end": 71.445}, {"text": "No audio or transcript leaves the phone as telemetry.", "start": 71.695, "end": 75.065}, {"text": "At denverlocal dot A I, the same idea serves small Denver teams: private AI, with sensitive files kept on hardware they own.", "start": 75.314, "end": 83.841}, {"text": "Local models first.", "start": 84.092, "end": 85.37}, {"text": "Built in the open, at hareet dot A I.", "start": 85.619, "end": 87.961}], "words": [{"word": "The", "start": 0.5, "end": 0.673}, {"word": "whole", "start": 0.673, "end": 1.019}, {"word": "production", "start": 1.019, "end": 1.538}, {"word": "stack", "start": 1.538, "end": 1.711}, {"word": "runs", "start": 1.711, "end": 2.056}, {"word": "on", "start": 2.056, "end": 2.229}, {"word": "one", "start": 2.229, "end": 2.575}, {"word": "laptop", "start": 2.575, "end": 2.921}, {"word": "with", "start": 3.236, "end": 3.416}, {"word": "one", "start": 3.416, "end": 3.776}, {"word": "command", "start": 3.776, "end": 4.136}, {"word": "Make", "start": 4.94, "end": 5.318}, {"word": "up", "start": 5.318, "end": 5.507}, {"word": "starts", "start": 5.507, "end": 5.695}, {"word": "fifteen", "start": 5.695, "end": 6.073}, {"word": "containers", "start": 6.073, "end": 6.64}, {"word": "the", "start": 6.64, "end": 7.325}, {"word": "edge", "start": 7.325, "end": 7.711}, {"word": "the", "start": 7.711, "end": 8.092}, {"word": "gateway", "start": 8.092, "end": 8.666}, {"word": "the", "start": 8.666, "end": 8.859}, {"word": "site", "start": 8.859, "end": 9.435}, {"word": "the", "start": 9.435, "end": 9.625}, {"word": "meter's", "start": 9.625, "end": 10.192}, {"word": "database", "start": 10.192, "end": 10.949}, {"word": "the", "start": 10.949, "end": 11.139}, {"word": "model", "start": 11.139, "end": 11.773}, {"word": "server", "start": 11.773, "end": 12.155}, {"word": "and", "start": 12.155, "end": 12.345}, {"word": "the", "start": 12.345, "end": 12.534}, {"word": "tools", "start": 12.534, "end": 12.724}, {"word": "that", "start": 12.724, "end": 12.914}, {"word": "watch", "start": 12.914, "end": 13.486}, {"word": "them", "start": 13.486, "end": 13.676}, {"word": "from", "start": 13.676, "end": 13.865}, {"word": "metrics", "start": 13.865, "end": 14.241}, {"word": "and", "start": 14